@startuml
!include ../../../themes/dark-theme.puml
title Verify TOTP or Backup Code

legend top
Entry point:
Login returned Login2FARequired

Policy:
- 2FA verification token is short-lived
- Per-user rate limiter protects attempts
- Successful verification issues full tokens
end legend

start

:Receive MFA code / assertion;

:Validate 2FA verification token;
note right
  JwtTokenVerifier checks signature,
  expiry, token type, subject, and
  the 2FA verification audience.
end note

:Check per-user TOTP rate limit; <<warning>>
if (Rate limited?) then (yes)
  :Reject login; <<failure>>
  end
endif

:Verify submitted factor;
note right
  TOTP secret is decrypted only for
  verification. A backup code is checked
  against its hash and consumed once.
end note

if (Factor valid?) then (yes)
  :Load user and generate access + refresh tokens; <<success>>
  :Store refresh token family member;
  :Return VerifyTotpSuccess;
  end

else (no)
  :Return INVALID_TOTP_CODE; <<failure>>
  end
endif

@enduml
